cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MCTS-guided LLM Negotiation: Strategy-level search with a learned opponent model"
abstract: >-
  Monte Carlo Tree Search over dialogue acts for LLM negotiation agents,
  paired with a learned opponent model that infers the counterparty's
  reservation price and persona from the transcript. Evaluated on
  CraigslistBargain and an agent-to-agent consumer negotiation dataset.
repository-code: "https://github.com/AI-Application-and-Integration-Lab/MCTS-guided-LLM-Negotiation"
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-03"
keywords:
  - negotiation
  - monte-carlo-tree-search
  - large-language-models
  - dialogue-systems
